"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">04</div><h1>인칭대명사</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Personalpronomen</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 04의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>A1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">1·2·3인칭과 존칭 Sie를 구별해요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">3격·4격 인칭대명사를 동사와 전치사에 맞춰 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">사물을 명사의 성에 따라 er·sie·es로 받아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">목적어가 둘일 때 대명사와 명사의 순서를 지켜요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Wir besuchen <span class=\"qblank\"></span> heute. (그녀를)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ihr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) sie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ihn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ihm</button></div><div class=\"qe\">besuchen은 4격 동사예요. '그녀를'은 1격과 같은 sie예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Ich helfe <span class=\"qblank\"></span>. (그를 도와요)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) er</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) ihm</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ihr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ihn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">helfen은 3격 동사예요. er의 3격은 ihm이에요.<br>한국어 '그를'만 보고 4격 ihn을 고르지 않아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Der Rock ist kurz. → <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ist kurz.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ihn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Sie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Er</button></div><div class=\"qe\">der Rock은 남성이라서 er로 받아요. 주어 자리라서 1격 er예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Das Fahrrad ist alt. → <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ist alt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Er</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Sie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ihm</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Es</button></div><div class=\"qe\">das Fahrrad는 중성이라서 es로 받아요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> (처음 만난 어른에게) '제가 당신을 도와드릴게요.'</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) Ich helfe Ihnen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich helfe euch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich helfe ihnen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Ich helfe Sie.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">helfen은 3격 동사이고, 존칭 Sie의 3격은 Ihnen이에요.<br>소문자 ihnen은 '그들에게'라서 뜻이 달라져요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Sie lernt Japanisch.에서 Sie의 뜻은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) 당신</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) 당신들</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) 그녀</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) 그들</button></div><div class=\"qe\">문장 첫머리라 대문자지만 동사 lernt가 3인칭 단수 -t예요. 그래서 '그녀'예요.<br>'그들'이나 '당신'이면 lernen이 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Ich brauche das Wörterbuch. → Ich brauche <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) ihn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) sie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ihm</button></div><div class=\"qe\">das Wörterbuch는 중성이에요. 중성은 1격과 4격이 같아서 es예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;euch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Wir kennen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(1격: ihr)</span> gut.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 너희를 잘 알아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir kennen <b>euch</b> gut.</div>kennen은 4격 동사예요. ihr의 4격은 euch예요(3격도 euch).</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ihr&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Die Farbe gefällt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(1격: sie)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 색깔이 그녀 마음에 들어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Farbe gefällt <b>ihr</b>.</div>gefallen은 마음에 드는 물건이 주어, 마음에 들어 하는 사람이 3격이에요.<br>sie(그녀)의 3격은 ihr예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;dir&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Wir danken <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(1격: du)</span> sehr.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 너에게 정말 고마워요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir danken <b>dir</b> sehr.</div>danken은 3격 동사예요. du의 3격은 dir예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;uns&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Der Fisch schmeckt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(1격: wir)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 생선 요리가 우리 입맛에 맞아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Fisch schmeckt <b>uns</b>.</div>schmecken은 3격과 함께 써요. wir의 3격은 uns예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ihnen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Der Ball gehört <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(1격: sie(복수))</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 공은 그들 거예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Ball gehört <b>ihnen</b>.</div>gehören은 3격 동사예요. 복수 sie의 3격은 ihnen이에요. '그들'이니까 소문자로 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ihn&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Wir bestellen den Salat. → Wir bestellen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 그것(그 샐러드)을 주문해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir bestellen den Salat. → Wir bestellen <b>ihn</b>.</div>den Salat는 남성 4격이에요. 관사 den의 끝글자 -n처럼 대명사도 ihn이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ihr&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Wir antworten der Nachbarin. → Wir antworten <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\">.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 그녀에게 대답해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir antworten der Nachbarin. → Wir antworten <b>ihr</b>.</div>antworten은 3격 동사라서 der Nachbarin은 여성 3격이에요. 여성 3격 대명사는 ihr예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich gebe ihr den Schlüssel&quot;,&quot;Den Schlüssel gebe ich ihr&quot;,&quot;Ihr gebe ich den Schlüssel&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 그녀에게 그 열쇠를 줘요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ihr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">gebe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Schlüssel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">den</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich gebe ihr den Schlüssel.</b></div>대명사 ihr가 명사 den Schlüssel보다 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir schenken ihm ein Fahrrad&quot;,&quot;Ihm schenken wir ein Fahrrad&quot;,&quot;Ein Fahrrad schenken wir ihm&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 그에게 자전거를 한 대 선물해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">ein</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ihm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Fahrrad</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">schenken</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir schenken ihm ein Fahrrad.</b></div>받는 사람 ihm(3격 대명사)이 명사 ein Fahrrad보다 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Ich zeige <span class=\"qblank\"></span> <span class=\"qblank\"></span>. (그것 = der Plan / 그녀에게)</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) sie ihm</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) ihr ihn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) ihn ihr</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ihm sie</button></div><div class=\"qe\">der Plan은 남성 4격 ihn, '그녀에게'는 3격 ihr예요.<br>대명사가 둘이면 4격이 먼저라서 ihn ihr 순서예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Die Tomaten sind frisch. Ich kaufe <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) sie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) es</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) ihnen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) ihn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">die Tomaten은 복수예요. 사물이라도 복수는 sie로 받고, 4격도 sie예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ihn&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Wir fragen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(1격: er)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 그에게 물어봐요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir fragen <b>ihn</b>.</div>fragen은 한국어로 '~에게 묻다'지만 독일어는 4격 동사예요.<br>그래서 3격 ihm이 아니라 4격 ihn을 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;es&quot;],[&quot;dir&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Ich schicke <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(das Foto)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(1격: du)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 그것(das Foto)을 너에게 보내요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich schicke <b>es</b> <b>dir</b>.</div>das Foto는 4격 es, '너에게'는 3격 dir예요.<br>대명사끼리는 4격이 먼저예요 — Ich schicke es dir.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;ihnen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> Wir essen mit <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(mit + 3격)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 그들과 함께 먹어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Wir essen mit <b>ihnen</b>.</div>mit 뒤는 3격이에요. 복수 sie의 3격은 ihnen이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;euch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Der Kaffee ist für <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(für + 4격)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 커피는 너희를 위한 거예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Kaffee ist für <b>euch</b>.</div>für 뒤는 4격이에요. ihr의 4격은 euch예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich bringe sie dem Gast&quot;,&quot;Sie bringe ich dem Gast&quot;,&quot;Dem Gast bringe ich sie&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 그것(die Suppe)을 그 손님에게 가져다줘요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">dem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">bringe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Gast</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich bringe sie dem Gast.</b></div>die Suppe는 4격 대명사 sie로 바뀌어요.<br>대명사는 명사보다 앞이라서 sie가 dem Gast보다 먼저 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Kinder schenken es der Lehrerin&quot;,&quot;Es schenken die Kinder der Lehrerin&quot;,&quot;Der Lehrerin schenken es die Kinder&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">아이들이 그것(das Bild)을 그 선생님께 선물해요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Kinder</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">es</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">schenken</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Lehrerin</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">der</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Kinder schenken es der Lehrerin.</b></div>das Bild는 4격 대명사 es예요.<br>대명사 es가 명사 der Lehrerin보다 앞에 와요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Wir zeigen ihr den Weg.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Wir helfen euch.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Die Jacke gefällt mir.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Wir schenken ihr es.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">대명사가 둘이면 4격이 먼저예요. Wir schenken es ihr.가 맞아요.<br>나머지는 3격 동사(gefallen · helfen)와 '대명사 → 명사' 순서를 바르게 지켰어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> '그 사과들은 그녀 거예요.'에 맞는 것은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Die Äpfel gehört ihr.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Die Äpfel gehören ihnen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Die Äpfel gehören ihr.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Die Äpfel gehören sie.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">주어 die Äpfel이 복수라서 동사는 gehören이에요.<br>gehören은 3격 동사이고 '그녀'의 3격은 ihr예요. ihnen은 '그들'이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> '우리는 그 노래들이 마음에 들어요.'에 맞는 것은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Die Lieder gefallen wir.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Die Lieder gefällt uns.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) Die Lieder gefallen uns.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Wir gefallen die Lieder.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">gefallen은 마음에 드는 것(die Lieder)이 1격 주어예요. 주어가 복수라서 동사도 gefallen이에요.<br>마음에 들어 하는 '우리'는 3격 uns예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;sie&quot;],[&quot;ihm&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Ich bringe dem Opa die Zeitung. → Ich bringe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(die Zeitung)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(dem Opa)</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 그것을 그에게 가져다줘요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich bringe dem Opa die Zeitung. → Ich bringe <b>sie</b> <b>ihm</b>.</div>die Zeitung은 4격 sie, dem Opa는 3격 ihm이 돼요.<br>명사일 때는 3격 → 4격이었지만, 대명사 둘은 4격 → 3격으로 순서가 뒤집혀요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Sie&quot;],[&quot;sie&quot;],[&quot;sie&quot;],[&quot;ihnen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> Da ist eine Lampe. <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(die Lampe)</span> ist modern. Ich kaufe <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(die Lampe)</span> und schenke <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(die Lampe)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(1격: sie(복수))</span>.</div><div class=\"qko\">저기 램프가 하나 있어요. 그것은 현대적이에요. 나는 그것을 사서 그것을 그들에게 선물해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Da ist eine Lampe. <b>Sie</b> ist modern. Ich kaufe <b>sie</b> und schenke <b>sie</b> <b>ihnen</b>.</div>die Lampe는 여성이라서 1격도 4격도 sie예요.<br>'그들에게'는 3격 ihnen이고, 대명사 둘은 4격 sie → 3격 ihnen 순서예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die Kellnerin bringt ihn uns&quot;,&quot;Ihn bringt uns die Kellnerin&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그 여종업원이 그것(der Kaffee)을 우리에게 가져다줘요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ihn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">bringt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">uns</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Kellnerin</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die Kellnerin bringt ihn uns.</b></div>der Kaffee는 남성 4격 ihn, '우리에게'는 3격 uns예요.<br>대명사 둘은 4격 → 3격 순서라서 ihn uns예요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"